{"3692570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bloodfront", "steam_appid": 3692570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Bloodfront is a top-down dark fantasy survival game where you build a village by day and defend it from endless demonic hordes by night.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are no second chances. When the village falls, the run ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/92c0f317d39fbabed74db220b76479b0.poster.avif?t=1788289324\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/92c0f317d39fbabed74db220b76479b0.webm?t=1788289324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/92c0f317d39fbabed74db220b76479b0.mp4?t=1788289324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Prepare by day. Survive the night. Repeat until you fall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bloodfront, each run is a single, escalating survival challenge. During the day, you gather resources, construct buildings, and position defenses. At night, demonic hordes attack your settlement from all sides, pushing your preparation to its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no progression between runs, only how long you can survive and how well you adapt before everything collapses.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/fe0cf5e5c18dd448368eba049c4f43b7.poster.avif?t=1788289324\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/fe0cf5e5c18dd448368eba049c4f43b7.webm?t=1788289324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/fe0cf5e5c18dd448368eba049c4f43b7.mp4?t=1788289324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay Loop</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day:</strong> Explore, gather resources, recruit villagers, and expand your settlement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Preparation:</strong> Decide how to spend limited time and materials to strengthen defenses or arm yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night:</strong> Relentless demonic hordes assault the village. If the settlement falls, the run ends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endurance:</strong> Each night grows more dangerous, testing planning, positioning, and reaction under pressure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/d00d7c240898bcd4bf88776cbae52d1c.poster.avif?t=1788289324\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/d00d7c240898bcd4bf88776cbae52d1c.webm?t=1788289324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/d00d7c240898bcd4bf88776cbae52d1c.mp4?t=1788289324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endurance-based survival</strong> — No meta progression, no carryover. Every run stands on its own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village building under pressure</strong> — Every structure matters when night falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating enemy hordes</strong> — Enemies grow stronger and more numerous with each night survived.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-down combat</strong> — Fight alongside your defenses using a variety of weapons and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day / night cycle</strong> — Calm, limited preparation followed by intense survival combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple enemy types and bosses</strong> — New threats force adaptation as the run continues.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Bloodfront is a top-down dark fantasy survival game where you build a village by day and defend it from endless demonic hordes by night.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are no second chances. When the village falls, the run ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/92c0f317d39fbabed74db220b76479b0.poster.avif?t=1788289324\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/92c0f317d39fbabed74db220b76479b0.webm?t=1788289324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/92c0f317d39fbabed74db220b76479b0.mp4?t=1788289324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Prepare by day. Survive the night. Repeat until you fall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bloodfront, each run is a single, escalating survival challenge. During the day, you gather resources, construct buildings, and position defenses. At night, demonic hordes attack your settlement from all sides, pushing your preparation to its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no progression between runs, only how long you can survive and how well you adapt before everything collapses.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/fe0cf5e5c18dd448368eba049c4f43b7.poster.avif?t=1788289324\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/fe0cf5e5c18dd448368eba049c4f43b7.webm?t=1788289324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/fe0cf5e5c18dd448368eba049c4f43b7.mp4?t=1788289324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay Loop</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day:</strong> Explore, gather resources, recruit villagers, and expand your settlement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Preparation:</strong> Decide how to spend limited time and materials to strengthen defenses or arm yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night:</strong> Relentless demonic hordes assault the village. If the settlement falls, the run ends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endurance:</strong> Each night grows more dangerous, testing planning, positioning, and reaction under pressure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/d00d7c240898bcd4bf88776cbae52d1c.poster.avif?t=1788289324\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/d00d7c240898bcd4bf88776cbae52d1c.webm?t=1788289324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/extras/d00d7c240898bcd4bf88776cbae52d1c.mp4?t=1788289324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endurance-based survival</strong> — No meta progression, no carryover. Every run stands on its own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village building under pressure</strong> — Every structure matters when night falls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating enemy hordes</strong> — Enemies grow stronger and more numerous with each night survived.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-down combat</strong> — Fight alongside your defenses using a variety of weapons and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day / night cycle</strong> — Calm, limited preparation followed by intense survival combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple enemy types and bosses</strong> — New threats force adaptation as the run continues.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Bloodfront is a top-down dark fantasy survival game where you build a village by day and defend it from endless demonic hordes by night. There are no second chances. When the village falls, the run ends.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/98a0e68b336025bba85178f8a418903fe29f1470/header.jpg?t=1788289324", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/4e0662528a684f16c2bac5bdc3289b89159cef29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788289324", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692570/4e0662528a684f16c2bac5bdc3289b89159cef29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788289324", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit <br></li><li><strong